{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14330","headline":"登玉鈎亭奉献淮南李相公 · 窦巩","name":"登玉鈎亭奉献淮南李相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西南城上高高处，望月分明似玉鈎。\n朱槛人云看鸟灭，绿杨如荠遶江流。\n定知有客嫌陈榻，从此无人上庾楼。\n今日卷帘天气好，不劳骑马看扬州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦巩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}